    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the Highlander, a Carrier capable of summoning a fleet of ships to defend you against endless waves of enemies.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/2cd7e46eb0a20d4acb9acf3ea492319a.poster.avif?t=1739728795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/2cd7e46eb0a20d4acb9acf3ea492319a.webm?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/2cd7e46eb0a20d4acb9acf3ea492319a.mp4?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine asteroids, gather resources, and survive as long as possible through each run.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/d45d52be33e3ca410fb705a2e57f013e.poster.avif?t=1739728795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/d45d52be33e3ca410fb705a2e57f013e.webm?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/d45d52be33e3ca410fb705a2e57f013e.mp4?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your gathered resources to unlock new ships and purchase hundreds of upgrades across numerous skill trees.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/cfc55b4a46f22e7641b0c066b3d6e841.poster.avif?t=1739728795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/cfc55b4a46f22e7641b0c066b3d6e841.webm?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413110/extras/cfc55b4a46f22e7641b0c066b3d6e841.mp4?t=1739728795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight through the prestiges and take down the final boss.</strong></p>",
